<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson sells RDS rights.</title>
<headline>Ericsson sells RDS rights.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's L.M. Ericsson AB said on Tuesday it agreed to transfer all production and marketing rights for its RDS products to Swedish unlisted company Cetronic AB.</p>
<p>RDS is a technology enabling motorists in Europe to receive notification about traffic information on their car radio whether they are listening to the radio or cassettes. The technology can also be used for messaging.</p>
<p>Ericsson has developed, manufactured and marketed a product programme of RDS systems. This will now be transferred to Cetronic. -- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
